{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2022-10-31 16:41:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC CLASS ACTION: LEVI & KORSINSKY REMINDS MEDTRONIC PLC INVESTORS OF THE PENDING CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT WITH A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF NOVEMBER 7, 2022 - MDT', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - OCTOBER 31, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN MEDTRONIC PLC ("MEDTRONIC" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: MDT) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF MEDTRONIC INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE DISTRICT OF MINNESOTA.'}{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2022-10-31 05:45:00', 'title': 'CLASS ACTION ALERT: THE LAW OFFICES OF VINCENT WONG REMIND MEDTRONIC INVESTORS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF NOVEMBER 7, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK , OCT. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ATTENTION MEDTRONIC PLC ("MEDTRONIC") (NYSE: MDT) SHAREHOLDERS: THE LAW OFFICES OF VINCENT WONG ANNOUNCE THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS. THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF PERSONS AND ENTITIES WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED MEDTRONIC COMMON STOCK BETWEEN JUNE 8, 2019, AND MAY 25, 2022, INCLUSIVE.'}